group Output
Output   "Output"     0 480   240   db -24 24                                      | Output gain in 0.1 dB steps
    how Sets the output gain, from -24 to +24 dB.
    sound It makes the whole sound louder or quieter after the EQ, without changing the tone.
group Mode
Mode     "Mode"      0 1     0     enum Parametric Graphic                       | Parametric: the eight bands above. Graphic: 31 constant-Q bands at the ISO third-octave centres, 20 Hz – 20 kHz, set by the G sliders; the response passes through every slider (the bands' overlap compensated), and the parametric bands rest
    how Chooses Parametric, with eight bands, or Graphic, with 31 third-octave sliders.
    sound Parametric suits precise surgery; Graphic suits quick tonal shaping across the whole spectrum.
group Graphic
G20      "G 20 Hz" 0 360 180 db -18 18 | Graphic mode: the response at 20 Hz (an ISO third-octave band), −18 … +18 dB in 0.1 dB steps
    how Sets the boost or cut at 20 Hz in Graphic mode, from -18 to +18 dB.
    sound Raising it brings the region around 20 Hz forward; lowering it pulls that region back.
G25      "G 25 Hz" 0 360 180 db -18 18 | Graphic mode: the response at 25 Hz (an ISO third-octave band), −18 … +18 dB in 0.1 dB steps
