# What the EQ measures (NeoEqMachine.Readings, machine_readings).
reading gain_match_db  dB | Short-term loudness out − in (K-weighted, 3 s): the editor's Match sets Output by it
reading b1_dynamic_db dB | Band 1's dynamic gain change now (negative: down), 0 while static
reading b2_dynamic_db dB | Band 2's dynamic gain change now (negative: down), 0 while static
reading b3_dynamic_db dB | Band 3's dynamic gain change now (negative: down), 0 while static
reading b4_dynamic_db dB | Band 4's dynamic gain change now (negative: down), 0 while static
reading b5_dynamic_db dB | Band 5's dynamic gain change now (negative: down), 0 while static
reading b6_dynamic_db dB | Band 6's dynamic gain change now (negative: down), 0 while static
reading b7_dynamic_db dB | Band 7's dynamic gain change now (negative: down), 0 while static
reading b8_dynamic_db dB | Band 8's dynamic gain change now (negative: down), 0 while static
reading q_capped_bands  | Bands whose Q linear phase limits (a band too narrow for its frequency: its ringing would not fit the FIR), 0 in minimum phase
reading pre_ringing_db  dB | Linear phase: the energy of the FIR's response before its centre, relative to all of it (left to left), -inf (-300) when the EQ is flat
